                                                "example_id": "135cc428-bfc2-4fd9-93b0-462a190cea65",
                                                "sense_id": "8318dae0-66f5-3944-b1c8-cac083591bca",
                                                "text": "We passed through the checkpoint on the road that passes through Freedonia."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "13c26e8a-be33-4ace-b8f5-d2b63d7b2e4a",
                                                "sense_id": "8318dae0-66f5-3944-b1c8-cac083591bca",
                                                "text": "At length, the two schemes were amalgamated to form the Manchester & Birmingham, which was to pass through the Potteries and join the Grand Junction at Chebsey, a few miles north of Stafford."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "02360436-f430-4f84-bb17-82035f90a753",
                                                "sense_id": "8318dae0-66f5-3944-b1c8-cac083591bca",
                                                "text": "Beginning where the road crosses the Sino-Soviet frontier at Man-chou-li, it passes through Hailar and Ha-erh-pin (Harbin) and ends when it crosses back into Soviet territory at Sui-fen-ho (Pogranichnaia). During its history it has been known as the Trans-Manchurian Railway, the North Manchurian Railway, the Chinese Changchun Railway and the Harbin Railway. The main line from Man-chou-li to Sui-fen-ho is 950 miles in length."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "80a128fe-d617-326a-b5dc-4e364eb0ef8c",
                                        "entry_id": "47cf7f34-8c2f-366f-a9cc-f0b225d40500",
                                        "glosses": [
